Subject: [202605] Restore Edgecore PDDF health and status LED APIs

Backport the reviewed health LED methods and matching PDDF labels for
AS7326, AS7726 and AS7816. Preserve native AS5835 LED behavior and hardware
register values. AS7726 CPU inventory follows in patch 0014.

Backported from ITJamie/sonic-buildimage accton-fixes at 2d7307eed68a21ce1b4a05461a7cd2b0c6e9a50d.
Shared watchdog helper: sonic-platform-common 1c8e439f9f14ef04dd05fa62d79e635c215d24d6.
Verified 202605 source: 5ef9e45ccf7f004fb07bf3f9be2f471cf00573bf.
Upstream PRs: https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-buildimage/pull/30780
https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-platform-common/pull/808
Remove when the target branch provides equivalent fixes.

